{"4355090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Game About Breaking Pots", "steam_appid": 4355090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the satisfying feeling of shattering pots. Explore a tranquil abandoned medieval castle, buy upgrades and smash every pot you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/ae7599fed28121c595468de2222ef8c6.poster.avif?t=1772696343\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/ae7599fed28121c595468de2222ef8c6.webm?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/ae7599fed28121c595468de2222ef8c6.mp4?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some pots might behave a little… different. They can bounce, teleport, fly, or even clone themselves. Some stick to walls. Some are big, some are small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/5d33a2c76ab9dae4f59979af1ad9cd04.poster.avif?t=1772696343\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/5d33a2c76ab9dae4f59979af1ad9cd04.webm?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/5d33a2c76ab9dae4f59979af1ad9cd04.mp4?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more pots you destroy, the more gold you’ll earn. Use that gold at magical altars to buy upgrades that allow you to reach new areas and explore the most hidden corners of the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/7af7c9332ef126d66dec4b370fbd0813.poster.avif?t=1772696343\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/7af7c9332ef126d66dec4b370fbd0813.webm?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/7af7c9332ef126d66dec4b370fbd0813.mp4?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, relaxing first-person experience focused on breaking pots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ beautiful pots to shatter with your sword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tranquil castle to explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different castle areas all linked together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pots with playful behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get upgrades to become more nimble and swing stronger.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the satisfying feeling of shattering pots. Explore a tranquil abandoned medieval castle, buy upgrades and smash every pot you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/ae7599fed28121c595468de2222ef8c6.poster.avif?t=1772696343\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355090/extras/ae7599fed28121c595468de2222ef8c6.webm?t=1772696343\" type=\"video/webm; 